	"data": "Skill Trees Index\n\nActive learning tracks for cithoreal. Each tree maps existing knowledge (anchors) to gaps and grows organically as learning progresses.\n\nHow It Works\n\"Teach me about X\" → I search the vault for what you already know about X\nAnchor mapping → Existing knowledge becomes anchor points on the tree\nGap analysis → I identify what's missing around those anchors\nTeach → Start from the nearest gap, work outward\nLog progress → Every session logs what was covered, understanding level,…",
